invalid type: string "How do I let you know that someone has died?\nWe understand managing someone’s death can be difficult. We’re here to help with the practical things you need to do.\nYou might find\nour online guide\nhelpful – it takes you step-by-step through what will happen.\nIf the person who died banked with us, please let us know as soon as you can.\nHow to let us know\nFill in our